    "details": "<p><strong>Welcome to the CTF SHASTRAA 2027</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Details:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex flex-col pointer-events-auto max-w-threadContentWidth gap-4 md:gap-8\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n<div class=\"w-full\">\n<div class=\"w-full flex flex-col\">\n<div class=\"group/partition flex flex-col group/final-text mt-2\" data-workflow-items-first=\"\" data-workflow-final-text=\"\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 min-w-0 gap-4 [&amp;+[data-workflow-text-footer]]:mt-1\" data-workflow-items=\"populated\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"break-words min-w-0 flex-1\">\n<div>\n<p>A nationwide Capture The Flag (CTF) competition for cybersecurity enthusiasts of every skill level. Whether you&rsquo;re an experienced hacker or a curious beginner, this event is designed for you. The competition follows a <strong>Jeopardy-style CTF format</strong>, and participants may form teams of <strong>up to 2 members</strong>.</p>\n<p id=\"event-stages\" class=\"font-semibold leading-tight text-pretty mb-2 mt-4 [[data-has-inline-images]_&amp;]:clear-end text-lg first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\"><strong>Event Stages</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"marker:text-secondary list-disc pl-8\">\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\"><strong>Prelims:</strong> A beginner-friendly online CTF challenge.</li>\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\"><strong>Finals:</strong> Qualified teams from the Prelims will be invited to compete offline at <strong>IIT Madras</strong>, racing to capture flags in a high-energy, competitive environment.</li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"challenge-categories\" class=\"font-semibold leading-tight text-pretty mb-2 mt-4 [[data-has-inline-images]_&amp;]:clear-end text-lg first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\"><strong>Challenge Categories</strong></p>\n<p>The following categories will be featured in both stages:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Web Exploitation</li>\n<li>OSINT</li>\n<li>Reverse Engineering</li>\n<li>Binary Exploitation</li>\n<li>Forensics</li>\n<li>Cryptography</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center justify-between motion-safe:animate-fadeIn\" data-workflow-text-footer=\"\">\n<div class=\"-ml-2 gap-1 flex min-w-0 shrink-0 items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
